#. Tag: para
#: commands-palettes.docbook:502
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the <guilabel>Sample merged</guilabel> checkbox is checked, the bounds "
"of the selection are determined by looking at the entire image instead of at "
"the current layer."
